# Hard Disk Sentinel Linux 二进制清单 (TSV, 制表符分隔)
# 字段: ARCH<TAB>SOURCE<TAB>URL<TAB>EXTRACT<TAB>DEBARCH<TAB>RPMARCH<TAB>ITER<TAB>DESC
# EXTRACT: gz = gzip 压缩可执行; zip = zip 压缩可执行; raw = 未压缩可执行
# ITER:   包迭代号(默认 1; 所有架构统一版本号, 不随 CPU 架构变化)
# 下载地址: 构建时从 URL 列抓取(官方 /hdslin/ 目录)
# ARM 架构按 CPU 代际拆分为 armv5 / armv6 / armv7 / aarch64 四个独立包:
#   - rpm 架构标签用标准名 armv5tel / armv6hl / armv7hl / aarch64
#   - deb 架构标签: armv5 -> armelv5, armv6 -> armelv6, armv7 -> armhf(标准), aarch64 -> arm64;
#     Debian 无按代际区分的端口, armelv5/armelv6 为可区分三代的非标准名
#   版本号统一从 release 的 v* 标签读取(如 v0.20 -> 0.20), 不在各架构间区分。
ARCH	SOURCE	URL	EXTRACT	DEBARCH	RPMARCH	ITER	DESC
i386	hdsentinel-019b.gz	https://www.hdsentinel.com/hdslin/hdsentinel-019b.gz	gz	i386	i386	1	32-bit x86
amd64	hdsentinel-020c-x64.zip	https://www.hdsentinel.com/hdslin/hdsentinel-020c-x64.zip	zip	amd64	x86_64	1	64-bit x86
armv5	hdsentinelarm	https://www.hdsentinel.com/hdslin/armv5/hdsentinelarm	raw	armelv5	armv5tel	1	ARMv5 (NAS, 未压缩)
armv6	hdsentinel-020-arm.gz	https://www.hdsentinel.com/hdslin/hdsentinel-020-arm.gz	gz	armelv6	armv6hl	1	ARMv6 (老版 Pi)
armv7	hdsentinel-armv7.gz	https://www.hdsentinel.com/hdslin/hdsentinel-armv7.gz	gz	armhf	armv7hl	1	ARMv7 (RPi4/NAS)
aarch64	hdsentinel-armv8.zip	https://www.hdsentinel.com/hdslin/hdsentinel-armv8.zip	zip	arm64	aarch64	1	ARMv8/ARM64
